// Converted 1:1 from apps/web/src/app/workbench/useAccessRuntime.ts (CXU plugins @ f2cb649d). Bulk conversion pass — defects logged, not yet fixed.
// Aggregator hook: owns the workbench's session/workspace/history state and
// re-exports sub-hook results. DEFECT: React hooks semantics (useState /
// useRef / useCallback / useEffect / useLayoutEffect / startTransition) have
// no SLA counterpart — state lives in UseAccessRuntimeState, sub-hooks are
// invoked once in useAccessRuntime_init via placeholders, effects become
// explicit caller-driven functions, and the returned object is the state
// struct itself (setters = field writes).

